  "user": "Give me reason code for transaction TX-0401 with amount 240.00 EUR.",
  "answer": "I can't find a reason code on transaction TX-0401. The transaction record has no reason-code field. Here are its details:\n\n- **Transaction:** TX-0401\n- **Date:** 2026-07-20\n- **Amount:** 240.00 EUR (debit)\n- **Merchant:** TechMart Online\n- **Type:** Card\n- **Status:** Settled\n\nReason codes are used when opening a dispute, and the one that applies depends on what went wrong. The available codes are:\n\n- **duplicate_charge**: you were charged more than once for the same purchase\n- **fraud_card_not_present**: a card payment was made without your authorization\n- **goods_not_received**: you paid but did not receive the goods\n- **service_not_rendered**: you paid but did not receive the service\n- **unauthorized_debit**: an unauthorized debit was taken from your account\n\nI also see a second debit of 240.00 EUR to TechMart Online on 2026-07-14 (TX-0402). If you were charged twice for the same purchase, duplicate_charge may apply. Tell me what happened with TX-0401 and I can check whether a dispute is eligible under the matching code before anything is filed. I won't open a dispute without your confirmation.",
